    'hls.ap.ops': 'Operations',
    'hls.ap.opsNote': 'Each addition and multiplication of the DFG (after unrolling) can use any library unit of its width. The group row changes every operation on the same source line. The own error is the error of the unit over the real operands of that operation; the next column is the error it alone would cause at the output.',
